<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="672968133"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:55.760"><div begin="23.948" end="43.077" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="23.948" end="28.608" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.948" end="24.627">你的</span><span begin="24.627" end="25.382">电话</span> <span begin="25.585" end="26.633">我还是</span><span begin="26.633" end="27.075">接</span><span begin="27.075" end="28.608">了</span></p><p begin="29.122" end="33.792" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.122" end="29.787">你约</span><span begin="29.787" end="30.517">见面</span> <span begin="30.681" end="31.067">我</span><span begin="31.067" end="32.093">还是</span><span begin="32.093" end="32.365">去</span><span begin="32.365" end="33.792">了</span></p><p begin="34.033" end="38.539" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.033" end="34.471">你</span><span begin="34.471" end="35.056">传的</span><span begin="35.056" end="35.644">晚安</span> <span begin="35.833" end="36.657">我</span><span begin="36.657" end="37.472">照常</span><span begin="37.472" end="38.539">回了</span></p><p begin="38.550" end="43.077" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.550" end="39.996">这样够吗</span> <span begin="41.806" end="42.207">够</span><span begin="42.207" end="43.077">吗</span></p></div><div begin="44.438" end="1:03.900" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="44.438" end="49.347" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.438" end="45.485">让自己</span><span begin="45.485" end="46.093">忙碌</span> <span begin="46.423" end="47.358">证明还</span><span begin="47.688" end="48.305">活</span><span begin="48.305" end="49.347">着</span></p><p begin="49.656" end="54.841" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.656" end="50.631">让朋友</span><span begin="50.631" end="51.205">陪我</span> <span begin="51.548" end="52.523">都不好</span><span begin="52.716" end="53.773">意思</span><span begin="53.773" end="54.841">了</span></p><p begin="54.853" end="59.409" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.853" end="55.508">我说</spa